{
  "id": "run-missing-key-shows-setup-steps",
  "description": "missing key/capability should show explicit setup next steps",
  "kind": "run",
  "argv": ["run", "create hello.txt with exactly hi"],
  "environment": {
    "homeMode": "missing"
  },
  "assertions": {
    "exitCode": 1,
    "contains": [
      "DeepSeek key: missing",
      "Capability probe: missing",
      "1. bobby login",
      "2. bobby"
    ],
    "notContains": [
      "[plan]",
      "[step]",
      "[evidence]",
      "[status] done",
      "你想让我具体做什么？请给我一个明确任务或要修改的文件。"
    ]
  }
}
